 ['Decision question and role boundary','question'],['Method and constructed evidence','cases'],['Minimum operating record','record'],['What the cases showed','analysis'],['Exceptions that stop routine work','exceptions'],['Protected pilot and scoring','pilot'],['Limits of the finding','limitations']
